// Song Descriptions
desc_tartarus: "The Dark Hour has struck and Bf and Gf haven't turned into coffins. Surprised by this and unsure what to do, SEES decides to take them to Tartarus but as they're chilling in the lobby preparing for their exploration, Bf decides to do another stupid rap battle with Makoto Yuki."
desc_truth: "Bf and Gf rush to JUNES to find the Investigation Team and tell them what they saw on the Midnight Channel last night. The Investigation Team decide to take Bf and Gf into the TV World as they might be able to give them clues about the recent victim and as they begin their search, Bf decides to do another stupid rap battle with Yu Narukami."
desc_desire: "Gf suddenly gets the MetaNav on her phone and accidentally activates it, transporting herself, Bf and the Phantom Thieves to Mementos. The Phantom Thieves try to send Bf and Gf back to the real world, however Bf decides to do yet another stupid rap battle with Ren Amamiya (Joker)."
desc_foggy-night: "Makoto Yuki and Yu Narukami have suddenly been summoned into the Velvet Room through their dreams. However this isn't the Velvet Room either of them remember. A great challenge awaits them so it's time for a good ol showdown!"

